+ * Translates subtitle lines in batches through the configured engine.
  *
- * <p>Translations are requested as a strict JSON object keyed by line
- * number, so that the result can be aligned back to the input precisely:
- * a missing, reordered or duplicated line number is detected instead of
- * silently shifting every following translation by one. When the model
- * returns fewer items than requested, the missing entries simply fall
- * back to the original text. A response that the provider truncated
